# 统一换行符为 LF，避免在 Windows 上提交时整仓库被改写为 CRLF。
* text=auto eol=lf

# 二进制资源：禁止文本化处理，避免 Git 尝试合并/转换
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.webp binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
*.ttf binary
*.eot binary

# 本地数据库（运行期产物）
*.db binary
*.db-wal binary
*.db-shm binary
*.sqlite binary
